    entry_queue["Gradio queue / FastAPI<br/>入口并发与会话锁"]:::entry
    ModelGateway_call["ModelGateway.call / stream<br/>每次调用共享预算"]:::orchestrator
    ModelProvider_primary["主服务 ModelProvider<br/>在途限制 / 熔断状态"]:::model
    validate["结构化输出 / 回复校验<br/>事实与隐私边界"]:::decision
    ModelProvider_backup["备用 ModelProvider<br/>独立 URL / Key / 额度"]:::model
    ReplyComposer["ReplyComposer<br/>必要时表达重写一次"]:::model
    reply_delivery["回复交付<br/>业务 / FAQ 完整后显示"]:::entry
    unavailable["模型服务不可用<br/>明确错误，不生成业务结论"]:::error
    tool_receipt["业务工具回执<br/>写结果不随回复失败重试"]:::storage
    risk_agent["RiskAgent 内容风控<br/>默认 passthrough / 暂缓完善"]:::planned
    entry_queue --> ModelGateway_call
    ModelGateway_call --> ModelProvider_primary
    ModelProvider_primary -->|"返回结果"| validate
    ModelProvider_primary -->|"超时 / 错误 / 熔断 / 忙"| ModelProvider_backup
    ModelProvider_backup -->|"备用返回"| validate
    validate -->|"可用事实"| ReplyComposer
    ReplyComposer -->|"通过关键检查"| reply_delivery
    ModelProvider_backup -->|"仍不可用"| unavailable
    ReplyComposer -->|"校验或改写仍失败"| unavailable
    tool_receipt -->|"回执事实"| ReplyComposer
    risk_agent -.->|"仅显式启用后审查"| reply_delivery
